[b][size=3]Legacy Mods:[/size][/b]
[list]
[*]Automatically installs [url=https://github.com/eArmada8/yumia_fdata_tools]Yumia fdata Tools[/url]﻿ merger to "package" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs .fdata mods to "package" folder, with support for variants. [color=#ffff00]Each variant must be inside a "package" folder for proper installation.[/color][/*]
[*]Automatically merges .fdata mods on deploy, and restores vanilla root.rdb/.rdx files on purge.[/*]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/nioh3/mods/83]RDBExplorer [/url]﻿is installed to the "package" folder. This is for manually injecting .g1t/.g1m files into root.rdb file. You can download it easily if you need it using the button in the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]
